  refused  NaN on the diagonal: cholesky: the matrix contains NaN at [3, 3]; refused by name before any launch, because a NaN carries the VENDOR's payload and every stage here is a certified card stage (IDENTITY_PATHS row 39)
  refused  +inf off the diagonal: cholesky: the matrix contains infinity at [2, 5]; refused by name
  refused  asymmetric cell: cholesky: the matrix is not symmetric at [7, 2]: lower 0x3e800000 upper 0xbf400000, relative difference exceeds CHOL_SYM_REL_TOL (2^-20). Refused by name rather than silently reading only the lower triangle, which is what LAPACK and cuSOLVER do and which answers a question the caller did not ask. DEVIATION 1638
  refused  wrong dimension: cholesky: the matrix holds 2304 floats, an 49 x 49 row-major matrix needs 2401
  refused  negative jitter: add_jitter: jitter must be non-negative, got a negative value with bits 0xbf800000; a negative ridge subtracts from the diagonal and turns a positive-definite matrix indefinite
  refused  NaN jitter: add_jitter: jitter is NaN; refused by name
  refused  unpinned jitter 1e-6: add_jitter: NUMERIC_IDENTICAL refuses the unpinned jitter 0x358637bd. The ridge is part of profile mojolearn.identical.cholesky.fp32.v1 and not a caller's free choice: three lanes call this and if each picks its own value then 'the same fit gives the same model' depends on a number nobody writes down. The two pinned values are 0x00000000 (no ridge) and 0x35800000 (2^-20). DEVIATION 1637. For a larger ridge, apply the pinned one more than once and record how many times; to change the value, that is a v2.
  refused  nb_hint=16 under IDENTICAL: potrf_lower: NUMERIC_IDENTICAL refuses the block-size hint nb=16. NB is a NUMERIC parameter of profile mojolearn.identical.cholesky.fp32.v1, not a tuning knob: it partitions the k axis of the trailing update, so two values of it bracket the same sum differently and return two different factors. IDENTITY_PATHS' rule has three moves and this one is PIN, so the pinned value 32 is used at every shape and a hint asking for another is refused rather than ignored. DEVIATION 1630. To explore block sizes, build NUMERIC_FAST and drop the cross-vendor claim; to change the profile's value, that is a v2 and not an argument.
  refused  singular fixture at info=38 (LAPACK contract, not an exception)
